 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/16 15:12| 03 | 005| 016| 0284| 0132| 0217| 0593|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/16 15:12| 06 | 065| 012| 0212| 0736| 0145| 1836|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/16 11:48| 02 | 250| 010| 0923| 0613| 0401| 1953|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/16 10:36| 01 | 243| 008| 0720| 0210| 0397| 0976|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/16 08:48| 02 | 068| 010| 0123| 0037| 0102| 0202|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/16 02:00| 02 | 075| 016| 025"
